3. Integrated Governance Router Engine
This Python orchestration hub acts as the central inter-division wire, binding the Executive Control Plane (beast-3.0-executive-control-plane), Legislative rules (division-002-legislative), Judicial approvals (DIVISION_003), Treasury disbursements (DIVISION_004), and Sentinel checks (DIVISION_005).
